# Collection-window config for the 인원 추이 (enrollment trend) history.
# refresh.sh sources this automatically (every make refresh / refresh-counts).
# Dates are YYYY-MM-DD interpreted in COLLECTION_TIMEZONE.
#
# A metric is sampled only inside its window(s); the other column is NULL. Outside
# EVERY window NO row is written, so the trend stays frozen off-season.
# _WINDOWS = comma-separated list of "DAY" or "START..END" (inclusive) — sampled on
# ANY match, so a metric can span several disjoint periods with dead gaps between.
# Full phase state-machine + rationale: docs/crawl.html#trend-windows
# VERIFY every semester against the sugang 수강신청 안내 (sugang.snu.ac.kr → co010.action).
#
# --- 2026학년도 2학기 (source: sugang co010.action, read 2026-07-04) -----------
#   07-29        예비장바구니 전산확정         -> nothing
#   07-30~07-31  예비선착순수강신청 1~2일차     -> 수강인원(e) moves   => ENROLL
#   08-04~08-05  장바구니신청 1~2일차          -> 장바구니(a) moves   => CART
#   08-06        장바구니 전산확정            -> nothing
#   08-07,10,11  선착순수강신청 1~3일차        -> 수강인원(e) moves   => ENROLL
#   08-28,08-31  수강신청변경(개강전)          -> 수강인원(e) moves   => ENROLL
#   09-01~09-07  수강신청변경(개강후/정정)      -> 수강인원(e) moves   => ENROLL
#   09-01~09-09  ★정원외신청 (학생→교원→확정)    -> 수강인원(e) moves   => ENROLL
#   09-08~10-20  수강취소 (slow drip)         -> 수강인원(e) 감소     => NOT collected*
# (*) 수강취소 tail is EXCLUDED: 42 days of slow drops would, at hourly sampling,
#     blow past export_json TREND_WINDOW=240 and evict the registration arc. Revisit
#     if the trend should show post-개강 drop-off (needs a bigger cap or slower cadence).

# Canonical worker scope. Explicit environment values take precedence, which lets
# a future date-window launcher provide a temporary per-window override.
COUNT_YEAR="${COUNT_YEAR:-2026}"
COUNT_SEM="${COUNT_SEM:-fall}"
COUNT_MODE="${COUNT_MODE:-cart}"
COLLECTION_TIMEZONE="${COLLECTION_TIMEZONE:-Asia/Seoul}"

# 장바구니(a) — only the main 08-04~08-05 담기 window is collected.
CART_WINDOWS="${CART_WINDOWS:-2026-08-04..2026-08-05}"

# 수강인원(e) — 예비선착순 · 본선착순 · 개강전변경 · 개강후정정/정원외
ENROLL_WINDOWS="${ENROLL_WINDOWS:-2026-07-30..2026-07-31,2026-08-07..2026-08-11,2026-08-28..2026-08-31,2026-09-01..2026-09-09}"
